WEBVTT

02:03.980 --> 02:06.980
"Final Act"

02:22.420 --> 02:25.690
The boar-like monster earlier...

02:26.170 --> 02:30.090
Do you think it was created 
by the miasma swamp in the mine?

02:30.090 --> 02:31.470
Who knows?

02:31.470 --> 02:39.810
All I can say is that there weren't many 
monsters here before the miasma spread.

02:39.810 --> 02:41.520
Really?

02:42.060 --> 02:46.020
But that boar looked rather large...

02:46.310 --> 02:51.490
While I cannot be certain, 
for a monster of that size to appear...

02:51.490 --> 02:55.150
There must be something different
about this miasma swamp.

02:56.700 --> 02:59.170
It'll be fine, Commander.

02:59.170 --> 03:00.270
That's right.

03:00.270 --> 03:03.800
We have the invincible Holy Saint with us.

03:03.800 --> 03:09.150
If anything happens, we'll use ourselves
as a shield to protect her.

03:09.630 --> 03:14.080
As long as Sei is safe,
 she can fix this, right?

03:14.080 --> 03:14.840
Yeah!

03:19.600 --> 03:21.810
I will be your shield as well.

03:23.610 --> 03:24.820
Count me in too.

03:25.230 --> 03:28.310
There's a new spell I would like to try.

03:28.310 --> 03:31.660
I'm thrilled we have such a large target.

03:32.460 --> 03:34.640
Now, let's hurry on!

03:34.640 --> 03:36.400
Yeah!

03:44.370 --> 03:45.760
It's right up ahead.

03:45.760 --> 03:48.870
Just follow this path to the mine entrance.

03:48.870 --> 03:51.070
Understood. Thank you.

03:51.070 --> 03:52.890
Please be careful.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.610
Are you all right?

04:15.610 --> 04:17.110
Oh, sorry...

04:17.110 --> 04:19.320
There are bats here.

04:19.320 --> 04:23.500
Looks like the mine has fallen into disrepair.

04:23.500 --> 04:25.450
Do be mindful of your surroundings.

04:25.450 --> 04:26.650
Right.

04:31.700 --> 04:34.000
<i>What's that smell?</i>

04:34.000 --> 04:36.010
<i>Wait, is it just me?</i>

04:42.640 --> 04:45.190
So they've finally appeared.

04:45.600 --> 04:47.990
Fall back a bit if this gets rough.

05:00.020 --> 05:01.610
Sei, stay in the rear.

05:03.750 --> 05:04.780
Here they come!

05:16.750 --> 05:20.100
The undead have already perished once.

05:20.800 --> 05:23.390
Keep your guard up even
 after you think they're dead.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.710
Yes!

05:27.140 --> 05:30.030
They aren't as formidable as expected.

05:30.030 --> 05:31.990
U-Um...

05:33.360 --> 05:35.480
It kinda stinks.

05:35.760 --> 05:38.330
Yes, well, they <i>are</i> rotting.

05:38.330 --> 05:40.380
It really reeks...

05:40.380 --> 05:42.450
I'm afraid complaining won't do much.

05:42.450 --> 05:45.880
Is it going to smell like this the whole way?

05:46.450 --> 05:50.150
As you can see, there isn't 
much ventilation here.

05:50.150 --> 05:53.630
It may get worse as we approach the swamp,

05:53.630 --> 05:55.950
but I doubt it will get better.

05:59.050 --> 06:01.040
Use this if you'd like.

06:01.040 --> 06:04.210
Holding it to your mouth and nose 
may make it easier to breathe.

06:04.210 --> 06:06.010
A-Are you sure?

06:06.010 --> 06:07.160
Of course.

06:07.510 --> 06:10.360
Th-Thank you very much...

06:13.170 --> 06:15.660
Well, let's get a move on.

06:35.250 --> 06:37.670
The undead are increasing in number.

06:39.000 --> 06:42.210
We must be getting closer to the swamp.

06:42.210 --> 06:45.180
I don't know how much longer
 we can hold out...

06:45.180 --> 06:48.210
We've already made it this deep.

06:48.210 --> 06:53.190
If we retreat, it will be 
difficult to regain ground.

06:53.190 --> 06:54.120
I agree.

06:54.730 --> 06:56.530
U-Um...

06:57.350 --> 06:59.190
Yes, what is it?

06:59.190 --> 07:02.900
We seem to have a lot of injured people.

07:02.900 --> 07:05.470
May I cast Area Heal?

07:05.880 --> 07:06.990
Lady Sei...

07:06.990 --> 07:10.060
I know I'm supposed to conserve 
as much as possible

07:10.060 --> 07:12.980
until we purify the swamp...

07:15.010 --> 07:17.440
But it'll be fine!

07:17.440 --> 07:19.750
I've been improving every day!

07:20.060 --> 07:21.480
My magic has increased

07:21.480 --> 07:24.970
and I should be able to use my 
holy power twice in one day!

07:24.970 --> 07:28.930
<i>Not that I've actually done it before...</i>

07:29.400 --> 07:35.530
I feel terrible that you've protected
me all this way, so let me help how I can.

07:40.080 --> 07:44.920
I understand, Lady Sei. 
Please cast the spell.

07:44.920 --> 07:45.940
Okay!

07:51.830 --> 07:53.430
Area Heal.

08:30.530 --> 08:32.490
There are so many...

08:32.490 --> 08:35.490
It'd be best to get Lady Sei 
to the swamp's edge,

08:35.810 --> 08:39.210
but it'd be nigh impossible 
to protect her against such numbers...

08:42.130 --> 08:46.130
Excuse me. May I perform a little experiment?

08:46.130 --> 08:48.110
An experiment?

08:48.110 --> 08:53.800
Yes. I would like to see if I can 
purify the miasma swamp myself.

08:54.200 --> 08:59.520
And even if I can't, I'd like to see 
what kind of effect I have on it.

08:59.520 --> 09:01.950
But there are so many monsters...

09:01.950 --> 09:06.980
It would be dangerous for us 
to fight them without you.

09:06.980 --> 09:10.000
Even so, it's worth the risk.

09:10.000 --> 09:12.950
If someone other than Lady Sei
 can neutralize the swamp,

09:13.320 --> 09:17.040
there'll be no further need for her
 to put herself at risk over them.

09:17.370 --> 09:20.120
Won't that be safer for Lady Sei?

09:21.290 --> 09:23.760
The opening attack will be enough.

09:24.590 --> 09:28.480
I understand. Just the opening attack.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.300
Thank you kindly.

09:37.600 --> 09:40.620
Now then, here I go.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.140
Holy Arrow!

09:58.360 --> 10:00.930
Well, it seems to be ineffective.

10:02.690 --> 10:04.800
So let us be off!

10:04.800 --> 10:06.420
Wait!

10:13.570 --> 10:15.200
Get ready, Lady Sei.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.220
Okay!

10:42.740 --> 10:45.490
As brilliant as ever. Wonderful work.

10:51.850 --> 10:54.530
So that's what the Holy Saint can do!

10:54.530 --> 10:56.870
What tremendous power!

10:56.870 --> 11:00.270
And that was <i>after</i> using 
a huge area-wide spell!

11:00.270 --> 11:01.940
I couldn't believe my eyes.

11:02.900 --> 11:07.440
I thought I'd finally created a spell that 
would work against a miasma swamp...

11:07.440 --> 11:09.420
But it was all over so quickly.

11:09.420 --> 11:13.400
<i>He sounds like he wishes
 this would never end...</i>

11:13.750 --> 11:18.490
Oh, I mean, it's not that I want 
new miasma swamps to appear.

11:18.490 --> 11:19.870
<i>Really now?</i>

11:21.780 --> 11:23.360
Watch your step.

11:23.360 --> 11:25.580
I will. Thank you so much.

11:28.690 --> 11:29.710
Huh?

11:42.810 --> 11:43.670
Sei!

11:43.670 --> 11:44.560
Commander!

11:50.020 --> 11:51.480
Sei?

11:51.720 --> 11:53.880
Sei!

12:09.000 --> 12:11.350
Ouch...

12:24.350 --> 12:25.550
Light.

12:27.590 --> 12:31.520
Guess I just have to see how far I can get.

12:31.520 --> 12:33.250
Oh, before that...

12:42.440 --> 12:44.410
Hate to boast, but my stuff is the best.

12:44.920 --> 12:47.590
I'm totally rejuvenated! Yup!

12:51.570 --> 12:53.440
My apologies. You really saved me.

12:53.440 --> 12:56.080
I'm also sorry for acting without permission.

12:56.080 --> 12:58.540
No, you made the correct decision.

12:58.540 --> 13:00.020
That's right.

13:00.020 --> 13:03.850
In any case, what was that monster?

13:04.180 --> 13:07.810
All the monsters within 
a certain radius of the swamp

13:07.810 --> 13:11.420
have always been eliminated
 with the purification before...

13:11.420 --> 13:14.770
Yet undead are still coming after us.

13:15.210 --> 13:20.490
Commander Hawke, this region has never
had a problem with undead before, correct?

13:20.490 --> 13:21.490
Yes.

13:23.700 --> 13:28.160
So a monster that shouldn't be here
lives on in the radius of the swamp.

13:28.770 --> 13:29.620
Don't tell me...

13:29.620 --> 13:35.380
I can't say for sure yet. Our utmost priority
 is to reconvene with Lady Sei right now.

13:35.700 --> 13:37.950
While her holy powers are formidable,

13:37.950 --> 13:41.870
Lady Sei herself cannot
 combat monsters directly.

13:41.870 --> 13:42.840
I know.

13:42.840 --> 13:46.240
We should hurry and find a way down.

13:46.240 --> 13:48.560
All right! Let's go get Sei!

13:48.560 --> 13:50.840
Yeah!

14:00.370 --> 14:03.180
There aren't any paths leading upward.

14:03.180 --> 14:07.770
And I don't think it's wise 
to go too far from where I fell...

14:08.850 --> 14:11.890
Everyone's probably looking for me.

14:17.300 --> 14:20.900
They'll find me, right?

14:24.050 --> 14:27.190
I'll get to see them again, won't I?

14:41.610 --> 14:46.790
<i>They laud me as the Holy Saint, 
yet I'm always in need of protecting...</i>

14:46.790 --> 14:48.600
<i>I'm useless on my own.</i>

14:53.140 --> 14:55.370
<i>I'm hungry...</i>

15:12.050 --> 15:14.460
I feel like we've come down quite far.

15:16.440 --> 15:19.220
We haven't seen anything in the way of clues.

15:21.400 --> 15:23.430
Lady Sei! Where are you?

15:23.430 --> 15:24.960
Lady Sei!

15:24.960 --> 15:28.320
Lady Sei!

15:28.320 --> 15:29.670
What is it?

15:31.800 --> 15:32.800
A breeze.

15:33.130 --> 15:33.790
Huh?

15:37.210 --> 15:38.500
A breeze?

15:38.500 --> 15:40.400
It's coming from this way.

15:41.960 --> 15:45.220
Maybe it leads to an exit!

15:46.550 --> 15:50.530
Sei! Where are you?!

15:52.930 --> 15:54.770
Sei!

15:57.640 --> 15:59.050
Sei!

16:00.450 --> 16:01.980
Commander Hawke?

16:02.300 --> 16:03.400
Commander Hawke!

16:03.740 --> 16:04.810
Sei!

16:05.610 --> 16:07.490
Commander Hawke!

16:07.490 --> 16:08.720
Sei!

16:08.720 --> 16:09.950
Commander Hawke!

16:16.330 --> 16:17.750
Sei...

16:19.380 --> 16:20.930
Commander Hawke...

16:29.090 --> 16:30.190
Thank goodness!

16:31.510 --> 16:33.720
Thank goodness you're safe!

16:38.440 --> 16:39.840
Commander!

16:44.480 --> 16:45.970
Oh, what a relief.

16:45.970 --> 16:47.720
Looks like you aren't hurt.

16:48.310 --> 16:51.490
I-I-I'm sorry for worrying everyone.

16:55.870 --> 16:59.750
Now then... where are we?

17:54.470 --> 17:56.530
An undead dragon?

18:00.770 --> 18:02.730
What in the world is that thing?

18:03.040 --> 18:04.520
I see...

18:04.520 --> 18:08.250
The reason the monsters weren't all destroyed

18:08.250 --> 18:10.690
is because the main miasma swamp is here.

18:11.180 --> 18:12.770
Lord Drewes...

18:12.770 --> 18:17.430
We'd like to get you closer 
to that giant swamp, but...

18:18.620 --> 18:20.660
Wh-What?

18:23.370 --> 18:25.710
This is...

18:30.300 --> 18:31.460
Ice Wall!

18:32.760 --> 18:34.010
Fire Lance!

18:38.200 --> 18:39.970
Holy Arrow!

18:44.690 --> 18:45.900
It worked?

18:47.910 --> 18:50.470
Lady Sei! Prepare the spell!

18:50.470 --> 18:51.480
R-Right!

18:57.070 --> 18:58.550
Lord Drewes!

18:58.950 --> 19:00.160
Sei!

19:00.830 --> 19:02.540
Reflection!

19:09.960 --> 19:11.170
Sei!

19:33.190 --> 19:36.150
Sei, the purification...

20:10.360 --> 20:12.860
Fire Storm!

20:21.070 --> 20:24.290
Lady Sei, it'll be fine. Stay calm.

20:25.170 --> 20:28.750
Don't worry. We'll absolutely protect you.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
Next Time

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
"Longing"
